# per-block zig cache (see the fleet brief: ZIG_*_CACHE_DIR must be in-tree
# or zig writes to %LOCALAPPDATA% on C:)
.zig/
.cache/

# per-block scriptc artifact cache (SCRIPTC_CACHE_DIR)
# (unanchored: each block worktree root has its own)
#
# Every SUFFIXED form too. An A/B needs one cache root per arm, so blocks
# spell .cache3 / .cache5 / .cache-sizecheck beside .cache, and none of
# those matched the rule above. Two commits already on main carry 44 object
# files each from .cache-sizecheck/, and a git add -A here swept 59 more out
# of .cache5/ into a commit meant to carry a paragraph. The rule that covers
# one arm has to cover them all.
.cache*/

# block lab: compiled probes and their captured output
lab/bin/
lab/runs/